# Differential oracle for water_mp2_sp_fc1: ORCA 6.1.1 MP2 on the same
# relaxed water geometry with ORCA's default frozen core, no RI. Its MP2
# correlation energy is PySCF's frozen_core: 1 value, not the all-electron
# default; the divergence is a convention the cross-program guide declares.
! RHF MP2 def2-SVP NoRI TightSCF
%maxcore 1000
* xyz 0 1
O   0.083323   0.083323  -0.000000
H   1.043716  -0.026894  -0.000000
H  -0.026894   1.043716   0.000000
*
